# md5 of every input of banks/v5div (md5sum format; `md5sum -c CODE.md5` from banks/v5div/, or python banks/make_v5div.py).
# v5div.py imports the v5 tools in ../v5/ (V5_CODE.md5 there; the bank's md5s are the same with the project's own copies).
# The clean files are the project's, byte for byte: P1 (pilot) + R1 + R2 + R3, the 851 kept templates the project fits on.
# Chunk R4 is NOT shipped: it is the project's fresh test set for this bank.
# v5div.py differs from the project's copy (md5 e1b731fda701ee55ad0cc17da192dcc8) in wording and one path only:
#   - the path constants (SIGNED = this banks/ folder instead of the project's signed-bank folder; V5 = ../v5);
#   - four comment / message / brief strings no longer name a person ("the project owner").
#   No edit touches the rows: SHIP_V5DIV.md5 is the project's record and is reproduced byte for byte.
